  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Free to Be Me Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building LGBTIQ+ civil society
Influencing norms and public opinion
Lobby and advocacy for legal and policy change
Economic Development</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LGBTIQ+ people face discrimination, violence and stigma in almost all facets of their lives - from access to justice, economic opportunities and employment, education as well as in health care.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The people we are targeting are LGBTIQ+ individuals, groups and organisations</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity focuses on strengthening the capacities of LGBTIQ+ civil society to lobby and advocate for their human and socioeconomic rights;</narrative>
  </description>
